---
// Generic no-disclosure error page (FR-060). Rendered identically for unknown,
// draft, or otherwise-unavailable tokens — it must NEVER reveal whether a quote
// exists or why the link failed.
//
// `e2e/patient-link-probe.spec.ts` asserts that two different bad tokens produce
// BYTE-IDENTICAL responses, and that the body contains no telltale substrings.
// Keep everything here static.
---

<main class="shell-document flex min-h-screen items-center justify-center py-10 text-center">
  <div
    class="border-border bg-card w-full max-w-lg rounded-2xl border px-6 py-10 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-42px_color-mix(in_oklch,var(--foreground)_42%,transparent)] sm:px-10 sm:py-12"
  >
    <span class="bg-brand mx-auto mb-5 block h-1 w-10 rounded-full" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <h1 class="font-editorial text-2xl font-medium tracking-[-0.03em]">Link nieaktywny lub nieprawidłowy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground mx-auto mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed">
      Ten link do kosztorysu jest nieaktywny lub nieprawidłowy. Skontaktuj się z gabinetem, aby otrzymać aktualny link.
    </p>
  </div>
</main>
